    "detailed_description": "On a planet near of Betelgeuse live the Kryhs.<br />\r\nThe Kryhs are crystal-mining creatures that live a monotonous life.<br />\r\nAs they say: &quot;Curiosity? Adventure? No, thank you. A happy kryh is a quiet kryh&quot; <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as Michi, the first adventurer Kryh.<br />\r\nExplore the world, meet other races, improve your equipments and customize your burrow<br />\r\nand most importantly: fly to the moon!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGreat adventures are waiting in Kryh Explorer!",
